    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ataliya mwenye jwamkongwe jwa ku Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ataliya, mama wawo Mwenye Ahasiya, ali apikene kuti mwanagwawo awile, ŵaganisisye ya kwawulaga ŵanace ŵosope ŵacalume, ŵa mwiŵasa lya Mwenye Ahasiya, nipo ŵalamwile kuti ŵandu ŵosope ŵa mwiŵasa lya mwenyejo, awulajidwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Yehosheba, mwanace jwamkongwe jwa Mwenye Yeholamu, mlumbugwe jwa Ahasiya, ŵamtisisye Yowashi mwanace jwa Ahasiya. Ŵajile kumsisa mcipinda cagona ca m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " pamo ni mundu jwakumlela mwanacejo. Ŵamsisile mwanaceju kumjogopa Ataliya, nipo nganawulajidwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowashi ŵatemi ni mundu jwakumlela jula kwa yaka msano ni cimo, ali mkuŵa m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE jila, Ataliya ali mkulamulila cilambo ca Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada akumjinjisya Yowashi mwenye jwa ku Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa caka ca msano ni kaŵili Yehoyada jwakutaga mbopesi, ŵatumisye mtenga kwaŵilanga acakulungwa ŵa asilikali ŵakulondela mwenye, pamo ni asilikali ŵakulondela nyumba ja ucimwene, kuti ayice ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE. Piŵayice asilikali ku Nyumba ja AMBUJEJO, Yehoyada ŵapangene nawo cilanga,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni ŵalumbilisye jemanjajo mu lina lya AMBUJE kuti ajiticisye, yakuti takamulane najo pa yindu yosope yakusaka kuyitenda. Ali amasile kulumbila,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kaneko Yehoyada ŵalosisye jemanjajo Yowashi, mwanace jwa Mwenye Ahasiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ŵasalile kuti, “Yingusosa kuti jemanja mtende ni ayi. Asilikali ŵa likuga lyandanda ŵatimciyika kutumicila pa lisiku lya Sabato, mgaŵikane patatu. Likuga limo likalondele nyumba ja mwenye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "likuga lyaŵili likalondeleje pa Cipata ca Suli, likuga lyatatu likalondeleje pa cipata cili kunyuma kwa asilikali, jemanjaji akalondeleje pa yipata yakwinjilila ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makuga gaŵili ga asilikali ŵitaciŵeluka pa Lisiku lya Sabato, jemanjajo ngusosa kuti tayice kulondela Nyumba ja AMBUJE, kuti tamcenjele Mwenye Yowashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwenela kumcenjela mwenyejo, jwalijose ali ajigele yida yakwe ya ngondo m'myala. Mundu jwalijose jutacilinga kwika paciŵandika, akwenela kuwulajidwa. Asilikaliwo akwenela kumkuya mwenyejo kulikose kutakajinjilile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵakulongolela asilikali ŵala ŵayitesile yosope, mpela muŵaŵecetele Yehoyada jwakutaga mbopesi jula. Jwalijose ŵayice ni likuga lyakwe lya asilikali kwa Yehoyada, likuga lyakuja kutanda masengo pa lisiku lya Sabato, pamo ni likuga lya asilikali lyakuŵeluka masengo pa lisiku lya Sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwakutaga mbopesijo ŵapelece kwa ŵakulongolela asilikali ŵala, mawupanga ni yida yakulinjilicisya ku ngondo yiyaliji ya Mwenye Daudi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yele yiŵayisungaga m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵakulongolela asilikaliwo, ŵapelegenye yidayo kwa asilikali ŵawo, kuti amcenjele mwenye, ŵajimice jemanjajo kusyungulila Nyumba ja AMBUJE ni malo gakupelecela mbopesi, ali ajigele yida yawo m'myala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada ŵamkopwesye Yowashi, ni ŵam'wecice cisoti ca ucimwene pa mtwe pakwe, ni ŵampele buku ja malamusi, ŵampungulile mawuta ga olifi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " pa mtwe pakwe, ni ŵamjinjisye ucimwene. Ŵandu ŵamgombele m'myala ali mkugumila kuti, “Akole umi wawulewu mwenye!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ataliya mwenye jwamkongwe, piŵapikene lisegwe lya kugumila kwa asilikali ni ŵandu, ŵajawile ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kweleko ŵam'weni mwenye ali ajimi pa cipilala cakwe ca ucimwene, mpela mwa msyungu wakwe wakwinjisya ucimwene. Ŵakulongolela asilikali pamo ni ŵandu ŵagomba mapenga ŵaliji ali amsyungulile mwenyejo. Ŵandu wosope ŵaliji mkusangalala, ni ŵaliji mgomba mapenga. Ataliya piŵayiweni yindu yeleyi, ŵapapwile yakuwala yakwe, ni ŵagumisile kuti, “Akunjimucila! Akunjimucila!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.23.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ayi 23:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada nganasaka kuti amwulaje Ataliya ali pa malo gakusyungulila Nyumba ja AMBUJE, myoyo ŵalamwile acakulungwa ŵa asilikali ŵa ngondo kuti, “Mumkoposye jweleju pasikati pa misela jimjimijo, nipo mumwulaje jwalijose jutalinje kumkulupusya jwalakweju.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo asilikaliwo ŵamkamwile Ataliya, ni ŵamjigalile ku cipata cakusapiticisya mahaci pakwinjila ku nyumba ja ucimwene, ni jwalakwejo ŵamwulajile pelepo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada akutenda cilanga ni ŵandu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada jwakutaga mbopesi, ŵamsalile Mwenye Yowashi ni ŵandu ŵakwe kuti aŵice cilanga mu lina lya AMBUJE, cakuti taŵe ŵandu ŵakwe ŵa AMBUJE. Ŵanduwo soni ŵaŵisile cilanga cakuti taŵe ŵakulupicika kwa mwenyejo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵandu wosope ŵajawile ku nyumba ja Baala",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni ŵajigwisisye. Ŵagumulenye soni malo gakupelecela mbopesi, pamo ni milungu jagumba jijaliji mwelemo. Ŵamwuleje Matani juŵaliji jwakutaga mbopesi jwa Baala, pasogolo pa malo gakupelecela mbopesigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo Yehoyada ŵaŵisile alonda ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panyuma pakwe jwalakwe, ni acakulungwa ŵa ngondo, ni asilikali ŵakulondela mwenye, alonda ŵakulondela nyumba ja mwenye, pamo ni ŵandu ŵosope ŵa mcilambomo, ŵampecesye Mwenye Yowashi kutyocela ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE, ni ŵapitile ku cipata ca alonda, mpaka kuja kwika ku nyumba ja ucimwene. Piŵajinjile m'nyumba ja ucimwenejo, mwenye ŵatemi pa mpando ŵa ucimwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
